            "updated_at": "2026-10-07T06:13:45.5457Z",
            "description": "Get detailed runtime behavior profile for a specific workload. Shows what processes run, what files are accessed, what system calls are made, and what capabilities are used per container. Compare with CVE findings to prioritize remediation - focus on vulnerabilities affecting actively used components."
        },
        {
            "id": "kubescape_get_configuration_scan",
            "server_name": "kagent/kagent-tool-server",
            "group_kind": "RemoteMCPServer.kagent.dev",
