            "created_at": "2026-10-07T06:11:45.460946Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-10-07T06:13:45.5457Z",
            "description": "List ApplicationProfiles showing runtime behavior of workloads. These profiles capture: executed processes (Execs), file access patterns (Opens), system calls (Syscalls), Linux capabilities used, and HTTP endpoints. Use this data to prioritize vulnerability findings - a CVE in an unused package is lower priority than one in an actively running process. Requires 'capabilities.runtimeObservability=enable' in Kubescape Helm chart."
        },
        {
            "id": "kubescape_list_configuration_scans",
            "server_name": "kagent/kagent-tool-server",
